Written for this repository on 2026-11-07: a one-sheet schematic of three
10k resistors in a row, none wired, the left two not numbered yet ("R?") and
the right one numbered R1, for tests/e2e/annotate.spec.ts (Number the parts,
with and without a kept designator) and tests/e2e/check.spec.ts (KiCad's
check of an unconnected pin). The resistor's definition is KiCad's Device:R
as Glasgow's schematic carries it (tests/fixtures/glasgow, 0BSD). The KiCad
files carry no comment (their formats have none), so this file holds their
license.
